    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Where in this stage are flows lost?",
      "description": "Flows per second not reaching the flows table, by the counter that saw them, for the selected stage. Normal: nothing above zero. Read with the queue and worker panels above: loss after a full queue is saturation, loss with an idle queue is an error.",
