      "description": "Errors that do not drop flows, per second: packets a parser could not parse, IPFIX or NetFlow v9 data sets skipped because their template was not known yet, and refused batch rows kept in flows_dead_letter. Normal: nothing above zero after the first minutes of a start. Rows kept in flows_dead_letter can be replayed; see the dead letters guide.",
